# PRJ-0001 — repository ignore rules
#
# Private / PII test data must NEVER be committed to this repository or pushed
# to any remote. Governed by repository ADR-0016 and
# frameworks/delivery-framework/.claude/knowledge/test-data-governance.md
#
# Real CV/resume content, names, email addresses, phone numbers, addresses,
# employment history, personal documents, and client-provided private data are
# local-only. Evidence references a test-case or synthetic identifier — never
# private content.
#
# Verify this protection with `git check-ignore -v <path>` — never assume it.

# Local-only test fixtures (designated location for any private test input)
test-fixtures/
local-test-data/

# Local-only working assets, never part of the committed deliverable set
# (project-repository-strategy.md's "what is committed" list: project.yaml,
# Briefcase, Engineering Blueprint, implementation/, evidence/ — nothing
# else). Marketing/cover-image drafts and iterations live here locally only.
cover-image/

# Document formats commonly carrying personal data, anywhere in the repository
*.pdf
*.doc
*.docx
*.rtf
*.odt

# Common local environment / secret files (defence in depth — ASDP never
# persists credential values, per credential-environment-governance.md)
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json
